🚽 Demonstrates #cooked <name> (the angle-bracket form): resolves "mathutils"
🚽 by searching $BRAINROT_PATH, then the install module directory, then the
🚽 directory containing the brainrot executable, for mathutils.brainrot.
🚽 Run with: BRAINROT_PATH=examples ./brainrot examples/modules_named.brainrot
#cooked <mathutils>

skibidi main {
    yapping("square(6) = %d", square(6));
    yapping("cube(3) = %d", cube(3));
    bussin 0;
}
